Package: xlocales-@origin@-gen
Version: @package_version@
Depends: libc-bin (>= @libc_version@), xlocales-@origin@-data (= @package_version@)
Conflicts: xlocales-@origin@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Thomas Munro <thomas.munro@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/macdice/xlocales
Description: Locale data from @origin@ compiled at installation
 Compiling during installation allows a simple non-architecture-specific
 package, but it a bit slow.  See xlocales-@origin@ for pre-compiled
 equivalent.
